# Sandgem Town, standing at the Pokemon Center door (177,843), early-game
# party, Poke Balls and a Poketch with three apps (Platinum's sandgem.recipe
# on D). Drives scenarios 2 (Route 201 grass: a wild battle and a catch) and
# 3 (Center heal, Mart buy, PC box).
#
# The vars are the coordinate triggers' own (zone events 327/328/396, the
# values their scripts leave behind, scr_seq 0392/0393/0985): Route 201's
# Rowan/rival scenes (0x4086 -> 3), Route 202's catching tutorial (0x4087 ->
# 1), Sandgem's lab escort (0x4071 -> 2), so walking west into the grass meets
# wild Pokemon instead of a cutscene. Base: the new-game save (bedroom).
name GQ
gender PLAYER_GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 27182
money 3000
var 0x4086 3
var 0x4087 1
var 0x4071 2
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 9 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_TACKLE
party SPECIES_STARLY 6 ITEM_NONE
item ITEM_POKE_BALL 10
item ITEM_POTION 2
poketch POKETCH_CALCULATOR
poketch POKETCH_MEMO_PAD
poketch POKETCH_DIGITAL_WATCH
map MAP_SANDGEM 177 843 FACE_DOWN
